# p2-ecm.drv - C7 slice 1: the ECM pulse, seen from outside the ship.
#
# Verifies: C7 (b)-(c) the ECM shell: one translucent shell round the ship
#         that grows and fades over the pulse's countdown; it holds still
#         while paused and runs faster under time acceleration.
# Run:  record once with --pace in --args and --timeout 400 (docs/hd/weapons.md,
#       ECM and energy bomb), then replay the tape to capture frames; the
#       tape lives outside git.  Unpaced, the waits run ahead of the pulses.
# Expect: the ship on its pad in the external view; three pulses round it:
#         one at 1x, one paused part-way for 3 s, one at 10x.
# Start 2 (landed), new game only: remove the beam laser for the cash,
# fit the ECM system, back to the views.
wait 6000
key space
wait 2000
key 2
wait 11000
# Comms, shipyard, upgrades; More to the last page; remove the beam laser.
mouse 57 193
click 200
wait 2000
mouse 270 52
click 200
wait 2000
mouse 170 58
click 200
wait 2000
mouse 298 160
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
mouse 141 102
click 200
wait 1500
# Go back, upgrades: fit the ECM system (first page).
mouse 151 161
click 200
wait 1500
mouse 170 58
click 200
wait 2000
mouse 129 136
click 200
wait 1500
# The views: front, then the view icon twice for the external view.
key f1
wait 2000
mouse 8 193
wait 300
click 200
wait 2000
mouse 8 193
wait 300
click 200
wait 2000
mouse 2 120
wait 300
shot 01-ext
# A pulse at 1x.
log ECM-1X
key e
wait 4000
# A pulse paused part-way for 3 s, then on at 1x.
log ECM-PAUSE
key e
wait 700
sdlkey esc
wait 500
# Paused, the shell holds still, so the shot is the same frame however long it takes.
shot 02-ecm-paused
wait 2500
log ECM-RESUME
sdlkey f1 shift
wait 4000
# A pulse at 10x (the time control), then back to 1x.
mouse 25 182
wait 300
click 200
wait 300
mouse 2 120
wait 300
log ECM-10X
key e
wait 1500
sdlkey f1 shift
wait 1000
quit
